# Rust
/target
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock is committed: purestat ships binaries, and an image built from a
# tag must resolve the dependencies the tag was tested with (v0.1.7's could not
# build: a fresh resolution pulled a crate needing a newer rustc).

